              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "The URL **`http://www.rewardclub.me/`** is the online portal for **Reward Club Malaysia (RCM)**, a subscription-based loyalty program and promotional platform operating in Malaysia. It is also associated with the domain **`rewardclub.my`**.\n\n### Business Model & Purpose\nRCM operates on a \"loyalty and giveaway\" subscription model\u2014similar to popular promotional clubs worldwide:\n* **Subscription Fee:** Members pay a monthly subscription fee to remain active in the club.\n* **Discounts & Coupons:** Active members gain access to a dashboard of exclusive discount codes, coupons, and vouchers from hundreds of partner businesses across Malaysia. These cover categories such as **Automotive** (car tuning, repairs, accessories) and **Trades & Services** (home improvement, fitness, health).\n* **Giveaways (Trade Promotions):** A significant draw of the platform is that active members receive accumulating entries into RCM's regular promotional draws and sweepstakes (which typically giveaway cars, cash, or merchandise). \n\n### Key Features\n* **Partner Network:** The platform advertises partnerships with over 300 businesses and redemption opportunities at more than 1,000 online and physical stores.\n* **Merchandise Store:** Members can purchase exclusive RCM-branded merchandise (such as apparel and bags) at discounted rates.\n* **Mobile App:** In addition to the web portal, RCM offers mobile apps on the Apple App Store and Google Play Store under the developer name \"Invotion LLC\". \n\n### Registration & Safety Info\n* **Eligibility:** Users must be at least 18 years old to register and participate in the promotional draws.\n* **Opt-Out:** RCM states that members can cancel their monthly subscription and opt out at any time without long-term lock-in contracts. \n* **Official Support:** Their primary support contact email is listed as **`cs@rewardclub.my`**.",
